best of your knowledge, you are aware that
cases of accidental needle injuries are
managed appropriately and based on local
protocols. There is an ongoing accreditation
process in place, in that regard, from health
authorities, and you are asked to express your
opinion about the subject. Which one of the
following would be the most appropriate
approach?','{"A":"there is no problem executing\nthe protocol and all needle stick\ninjuries are managed appropriately.","B":"Share your understanding of the\nprotocol and how it runs in the\nhospital.","C":"Give an example of a case you know\nand how it was managed.","D":"Leave the answer to your\nSupervisors.","E":"them you do not know all the\ndetails and cannot give them\naccurate information."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 1.pdf","supporting_pages":[139,140],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-759e34f01bb2","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"6c0849745a56594cc20f","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 1.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 1.pdf","source_page":139,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_cross_page_option_stitch","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"6c0849745a56594cc20f","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 1.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 1.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":139,"supporting_pages":[139,140],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Ethics/Population Health","stem":"You are an intern in a teaching hospital. To the\nbest of your knowledge, you are aware that\ncases of accidental needle injuries are\nmanaged appropriately and based on local\nprotocols. There is an ongoing accreditation\nprocess in place, in that regard, from health\nauthorities, and you are asked to express your\nopinion about the subject. Which one of the\nfollowing would be the most appropriate\napproach?","options":{"A":"there is no problem executing\nthe protocol and all needle stick\ninjuries are managed appropriately.","B":"Share your understanding of the\nprotocol and how it runs in the\nhospital.","C":"Give an examp