GP clinic, presents to you for a health check-
up before she goes on a European tour that
includes bush walking and traveling through
mountains. On examination, you notice a
decline in her recent memory, as well as
having trouble remembering new people''s
names and addresses. You perform a Mini-
mental state exam (MMSE) for her, the result
of which is 24/30. You recommend that she
cancel her tour until a further assessment is
carried out because due to her current
condition, you think she is unfit to travel
alone. She refuses and tells you that she will
