parents to the clinic for cold symptoms. She has
been living with the family for the past six
months and has just started school. During the
consultation, she seemed withdrawn and
avoided eye contact. To you, she seems a bit
worried and anxious. You consider the
possibility of child abuse. Of the following
options, which one is least likely to be present in
a child victim of sexual abuse?','{"A":"Defying the foster parents.","B":"Bruises on the buttocks.","C":"Vaginal discharge.","D":"Anxiety.","E":"Bedwetting."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-7498726c1422","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"b19e37a37cd62945ca2b","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_page":10,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"812c9d9d4419f49b0037","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_page":11,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"b19e37a37cd62945ca2b","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":10,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Ethics/Population Health","stem":"Tara, 6 years old, was brought in by his foster\nparents to the clinic for cold symptoms. She has\nbeen living with the family for the past six\nmonths and has just started school. During the\nconsultation, she seemed withdrawn and\navoided eye contact. To you, she seems a bit\nworried and anxious. You consider the\npossibility of child abuse. Of the following\noptions, which one is least likely to be present in\na child victim of sexual abuse?","options":{"A":"Defying the foster parents.","B":"Bruises on the buttocks.","C":"Vaginal discharge.","D":"Anxiety.","E":"Bedwetting."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_st