history of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease
(COPD) has an advance directive of a DNR (do
not resuscitate) order in place. She is now in the
emergency department with a femoral neck
fracture sustained at home. She is drowsy and
disoriented. Her son and daughter are in the
emergency department asking you to do
whatever it takes to treat her. Which one of the
following should be your next appropriate
action?','{"A":"Inform her son and daughter that\nShe will be given all necessary\ntreatment.","B":"Wait until she regains her\nconsciousness and discuss the\nmatter with her.","C":"Inform your senior doctor.","D":"Inform her son and daughter that\nthere is nothing you can do as she\nis DNR.","E":"Refer the case to Guardianship\nTribunal."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","supporting_pages":[19,20],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-0b5b37fc36e4","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"9ab5f5f235b26edca2f2","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_page":19,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_cross_page_option_stitch","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"9ab5f5f235b26edca2f2","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":19,"supporting_pages":[19,20],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Ethics/Population Health","stem":"An 86-year-old woman with a longstanding\nhistory of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease\n(COPD) has an advance directive of a DNR (do\nnot resuscitate) order in place. She is now in the\nemergency department with a femoral neck\nfracture sustained at home. She is drowsy and\ndisoriented. Her son and daughter are in the\nemergency department asking you to do\nwhatever it takes to treat her. Which one of the\nfollowing should be your next appropriate\naction?","options":{"A":"Inform her son and daughter that\nShe will be given all necessary\ntreatment.","B":"Wait until she regains her\nconsciousness and discuss the\nmatter with her.","C":"Inform your senior doctor.","D":"Inform her son and dau