Emergency Department with internal bleeding
from injuries sustained in a motor vehicle crash.
The patient has been stabilized but requires a
blood transfusion prior to planned emergency
surgery. When he is asked to give consent for
the transfusion, he states that blood transfusion
is forbidden in his religion. Which one of the
following is the most appropriate next step in
management?','{"A":"Assess the patient''s decision-\nmaking capacity to refuse the\ntransfusion.","B":"Call the patient''s wife to obtain\nconsent for the transfusion.","C":"Call the Guardianship Court for\nconsent.","D":"Proceed with transfusion against\nthe patient''s wish.","E":"Talk to the patient about blood\nsubstitutes and ask him if he would\nlike to consider them."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-20844da46eb2","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"8d0c97c4e213eba4f74e","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_page":67,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"8d0c97c4e213eba4f74e","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":67,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Ethics/Population Health","stem":"A 49-year-old married man is brought to the\nEmergency Department with internal bleeding\nfrom injuries sustained in a motor vehicle crash.\nThe patient has been stabilized but requires a\nblood transfusion prior to planned emergency\nsurgery. When he is asked to give consent for\nthe transfusion, he states that blood transfusion\nis forbidden in his religion. Which one of the\nfollowing is the most appropriate next step in\nmanagement?","options":{"A":"Assess the patient''s decision-\nmaking capacity to refuse the\ntransfusion.","B":"Call the patient''s wife to obtain\nconsent for the transfusion.","C":"Call the Guardianship Court for\nconsent.","D":"Proceed with transfusion against\nthe patient'