by her mother, for a health check. She asks to
be examined alone without her mother in the
room. During the examination, she requests a
Chlamydia test. Based on your assessments,
she appears to fully understand the test and the
impact of the results. You take a swab to send
to a local laboratory. After one week you receive
the test result which is negative. Today, the
mother called your office and tells you that she
knows about her daughter being tested for
Chlamydia and she wants to know the result.
Which one of the following would be the most
appropriate response to her request?','{"A":"Do not tell her.","B":"Tell her that the test result is\nnegative.\n''e Tell her that the results have not","C":"come through yet.","D":"Ask her to come with her daughter\nfor the next appointment.","E":"Tell her that you can disclose the\nresuTTrronly TO le, Gauaunter."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-2b4abc0a8d44","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"0af680f8e8c5b8df6486","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_page":84,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"five_block_inferred","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','low','{"record_id":"0af680f8e8c5b8df6486","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":84,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Ethics/Population Health","stem":"A 14-year-old girl presents to you, accompanied\nby her mother, for a health check. She asks to\nbe examined alone without her mother in the\nroom. During the examination, she requests a\nChlamydia test. Based on your assessments,\nshe appears to fully understand the test and the\nimpact of the results. You take a swab to send\nto a local laboratory. After one week you receive\nthe test result which is negative. Today, the\nmother called your office and tells you that she\nknows about her daughter being tested for\nChlamydia and she wants to know the result.\nWhich one of the following would be the most\nappropriate response to her request?","options":{"A":"Do not tell her.","B":"Tell her that the test result is\nnegative.\n''e Tell her that the results have 