the hospital where you work, visits you to
inquire about the contents of her living will. You
have previously attended to her case as one of
her physicians. She is very friendly with the
hospital staff, nurses, and other medical
workers and tells you that “she sees you as
family.” She lives alone and has an estranged
relationship with her children, who live abroad.
