retarded daughter who is eight weeks
pregnant. The mother requests an abortion
for her daughter as she is unable to look after
herself. The patient does not want an
abortion. Which one of the following is the
most appropriate action to take?','{"A":"Perform medical abortion as it is\nclose to nine weeks; otherwise she\nwill require surgical abortion.","B":"Do not perform abortion as the\npatient did not consent.","C":"Refer the matter to Family Court.","D":"Get consent from the local council.","E":"Discuss the matter with the father\n\nof the girl in a week."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","supporting_pages":[],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-365e08187c90","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"251bcd4a67ec4d5c3fbb","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_page":106,"source_qid":null},{"record_id":"823509e82257e9db95eb","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_page":107,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"strict_ocr_tolerant","text_method":"tesseract_retry_200dpi_psm3","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"251bcd4a67ec4d5c3fbb","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 Ethics file 3.pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":106,"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Ethics/Population Health","stem":"A mother brings her 18-year-old mentally\nretarded daughter who is eight weeks\npregnant. The mother requests an abortion\nfor her daughter as she is unable to look after\nherself. The patient does not want an\nabortion. Which one of the following is the\nmost appropriate action to take?","options":{"A":"Perform medical abortion as it is\nclose to nine weeks; otherwise she\nwill require surgical abortion.","B":"Do not perform abortion as the\npatient did not consent.","C":"Refer the matter to Family Co